OL,3,GNEWSAStates member suspended after
OL,4,Abreaching rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ruling related to an allegation he
OL,7,Fhad told a member of the public a
OL,8,Fproposed data centre was "going into
OL,9,FMannez Quarry," when the decision had
OL,10,Fnot been taken by the States and the
OL,11,Fproject had been "at a confidential
OL,12,Fexploratory stage".
OL,14,FSnowdon said he had been acting in the
OL,15,Fpublic interest and previously
OL,16,Fsuggested the complaint had been
OL,17,Fpolitically motivated and lacked
OL,18,Fcredibility.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
